Dockerfile
You can specify:
USER 1000

This says:
The image expects the process to run as UID 1000.

SCC
SCC says:
The Pod is allowed or not allowed to run with this UID.

Dockerfile
    │
    │ requests UID 1000
    ▼
Container configuration
    │
    ▼
SCC
    │
    ├── Allowed
    │
    └── Rejected
